# Repository corpus (M05 WP1): non-fixture Starlark sources in this package
# owned for direct-Bazel dogfood under the canonical real_fixture_policy.
# Fixture-owned evidence files stay excluded (evidence frozen); Markdown
# and TOML here are fixture-owned or bound configs, so no md/toml corpus.
